# llm-draft
msgid "The configuration does not load"
msgstr "Die Konfiguration lässt sich nicht laden"

# llm-draft
msgid "The crew chief will have opinions about this one."
msgstr "Der Crew Chief wird dazu seine Meinung haben."

# llm-draft
msgid "The enemy had just finished its own takeoff checklist. A pity, really."
msgstr "sgstr \"Der Gegner hatte gerade die Startcheckliste abgehakt. Schade eigentlich."

# llm-draft
msgid "The enemy was well and truly damaged. Somebody else just happened to be standing at the finish line."
msgstr "Der Gegner war ordentlich angeschlagen. Ein anderer stand halt zufällig an der Ziellinie."

# llm-draft
msgid "The engine never got to say a word. The ground crew would like it noted that the aircraft was ready."
msgstr "sgstr \"Der Motor kam nicht mal zum Husten. Die Bodencrew bestätigt: Die Maschine war einwandfrei."

